        'Outside of folders file access policy': '工作文件夹外文件访问策略',
        'Configures how the agent tries to access files outside of its working folders.': '配置文件访问策略，控制智能体如何访问工作文件夹外部的文件。',
        'Terminal Command Auto Execution': '终端命令自动执行',
